---
description: Data layer and types
globs: lib/**,types/**,data/**
alwaysApply: false
---
- Every /lib data function is async and returns types from /types.
- One file per content type in /types (e.g. types/project.ts).
- Never change a type's shape (field names, slug as plain string) unless asked.
- Sorting, filtering, and "featured" logic lives in /lib, not in pages.
- /data is temporary fake content and will be deleted.
